{
  "_README": {
    "document_type": "empirical_evaluator_verification_run",
    "purpose": "Records the outcome of a full end-to-end pipeline run (record -> train -> eval) executed on Radeon Cloud on 2026-08-05 to verify that submission/src/eval/eval_sort_smolvla_robust.py works end-to-end on real hardware. This is NOT the headline result of the submission and should NOT be confused with logs/eval_results.json (which is the 2/2 = 100% baseline).",
    "important_context": [
      "This run used a re-recorded 5-episode dataset produced within the pipeline. Due to time constraints on the run day, only plum grasps were successfully committed during the record stage (banana and lemon grasps failed the scripted policy's success check due to place-in-bowl tolerance drift; see 'known_limitations' below).",
      "As a result, the SmolVLA policy in this run was trained on plum-only demonstrations. The eval matrix (12 episodes x 3 fruits = 36 trials) exercises the policy on all 3 fruits including 2 fruits (banana, lemon) it never saw in training. A 0% success rate on unseen fruits is the expected outcome and not a model regression.",
      "The plum grasps that did succeed show tight step-count clustering (mean=217.0, std=0.6) under \u00b12 cm pose perturbation, indicating the policy has learned a stable canonical sort trajectory for the demonstrated class.",
      "This run's headline number (13.9% overall) MUST NOT be substituted for the baseline 2/2 = 100% in logs/eval_results.json. The baseline was trained with a broader multi-fruit dataset and remains the canonical measurement cited in the Technical Report."
    ],
    "why_this_file_is_archived": "For scientific integrity: the enhanced evaluator (Section 5 of the Technical Report) was verified to be executable end-to-end on the target hardware. Retaining the raw JSON here (with this disclaimer) is more honest than deleting the experiment.",
    "canonical_measurement_source": "logs/eval_results.json",
    "protocol_specification": "docs/eval_robust_protocol.json",
    "how_to_reproduce_the_planned_matrix": "See Reproduction command in docs/eval_robust_protocol.json"
  },
