    "known_limitations": [
      "Dataset skew: 5/5 committed demonstrations are 018_plum only; banana/lemon have zero training examples in this run.",
      "Scripted-policy grasp instability: on this build of Genesis (1.2.3 with PyTorch 2.9.1 nightly ROCm 7.2), the yaw_offset/close_force overrides in sort_demo.py's grasp profiles produced enough sim-time variance that banana and lemon grasps missed the bowl's success-tolerance criterion during the record stage on every attempt.",
      "The 41.7% plum success rate (5/12) with mean 217 +/- 0.6 steps is consistent with 'the policy converged on a single canonical plum trajectory that is +/-2cm robust on the y-axis but does not generalize to the perturbation extremes'."
    ]
  },
